Changelog: 14-11-2026 15:41:37

Added. A check that the BC250 Bazzite Suite's wiki's Portal Tour keeps up with its portal (owner, 14-11-2026). bc250-bazzite/tools/record-tour.sh --wiki
writes bc250-bazzite/tools/portal-tour.stamp, a fingerprint of what the video shows (the portal's code and pictures and the tour's
script; the portal's version is left out, so a release does not count). bc250-bazzite/tools/portal_tour.py --check says whether
the portal changed since, and tools/tests runs it, so the checks fail until the tour is recorded again with --wiki;
--stamp marks the video as current for a change that does not show in it. The message also reminds of the wiki's
Portal page. The wiki's Development chapter has it.

