checks the navigation against the portal's manifest.

Changelog: 13-11-2026 21:08:01

Breaking. The Bazzite Console Suite is standalone again and Nexus no longer knows it (owner, 13-11-2026: that
repository is and stays standalone, with its own tooling; the entry of 13-11-2026 20:18:54 is undone). Gone: the
