Changelog: 13-11-2026 16:21:04

Release 5.0.0.

Changelog: 13-11-2026 15:34:58

Breaking. The Bazzite Console Suite left Nexus (owner, 13-11-2026: back to one repository per suite). Its folder
`bazzite-console/` and its workflows `ci-bazzite-console.yml` and `release-bazzite-console.yml` are removed. The
shared workflows no longer name it: `docs.yml` builds no wiki for it, `release-nexus.yml` has no job for it,
`nexus-index.yml` does not wait for its release workflow and `release.yml` no longer excludes `ps5-` tags.
`tools/ci_local.py` runs `ci.yml` and `ci-nexus.yml`, `tools/make_icons.py` and `tools/make_design.py` list no
console suite (ICONS.md and DESIGN.md written again), `tools/new_app.py` has no template for its portal, and
`nexus/features.toml` with the Nexus page's Apps and features chapter has no Console column and no Decky Loader
Manager. The Nexus page's home, Development, Releases and Dashboard chapters, the README and the instruction files
follow. The tests of the tools, Nexus Dashboard and Nexus Installer Tests use the two suites that remain.

